Casterwill's youngest daughter fought alongside her family in the great war against the [[Nullifiers]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

She has her siblings were teleported by [[Umbra]] to the [[Spiral Mark]], where she watched Lord Casterwill seal the Mark using the [[Willblade]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

Some time after the death of Lord Casterwill, on the longest night of the year, she and her siblings fought [[the Betrayer]] at the [[Spiral Mark]], stopping him from using [[Void]] to call back the Nullifiers. {{source|Chasing Void}}

She eventually laid the [[Ring]] of Phoenix to rest in the [[Phoenix Volcano]] where it was eventually recovered by [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}
